TEXT 896 208 Left 2 ;NOTE: \nSome words to the additional load\nbecause of petersen at the transformer\nThe load of the tranformer\nis mainly determined by active power\nIn contrairy the petersen current is inductive\nand is fed by all three phases in parallel (samephased)\nSince active and reactive power are added\nvectorial the additional load through \npetersen coil is rather low (S=P+jQ/3)
